          "detail": "<p>If the target creature is <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/BLU/peripheral_synthesis.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\"><strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.thBevyZDOURijH8I]{Petrify}</strong>, this attack is guaranteed to hit regardless of Accuracy Check.</p>",
