          "attrib_1": "MIG",
          "attrib_2": "MIG",
          "basic_name": "⚔️ Rock Swallow",
          "check_bonus": "0",
          "detail": "<p>Can only be used on the creature that is <strong><img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Bludgeon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\">@UUID[JournalEntry.FV8JefaHsehzgXR7]{Grappled}&nbsp;</strong>by&nbsp;<strong>Basilisk&nbsp;</strong>and is <img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Buff%20Icon/Paralyze.png\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\"><strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.GqqgHkKOs0hkghdG]{Paralyzed}.</strong></p>\n<p>The target creature become&nbsp;<strong>Swallowed&nbsp;</strong>and <strong>loses all its turn&nbsp;</strong>until the end of scene,<strong>&nbsp;Basilisk&nbsp;</strong>performs <strong>Rock Spit,&nbsp;</strong>or <strong>Basilisk</strong>'s<strong>&nbsp;Hit Points&nbsp;</strong>is dropped to 0.</p>\n<p>Once this attack is resolved,&nbsp;<strong>Basilisk&nbsp;</strong>becomes&nbsp;<strong>Full&nbsp;</strong>and may only use <strong>Digest&nbsp;</strong>or <strong>Rock Spit</strong>.</p>",
          "dmg_bonus": "10",
          "icon": "<i class=\"fa-solid fa-swords\"></i>",
          "roll": "",
